              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-frame page\" id=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-zoom\">\n      <div class=\"hero-drop\">\n        <div class=\"kb\" style=\"background-image:url('/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/room-bedroom.webp')\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-copy center\">\n      <span class=\"label\">Stay With Us</span>\n      <h1><span class=\"line\"><i>The Rooms</i></span></h1>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- INTRO -->\n<section class=\"intro\">\n  <p class=\"reveal\">Each room is wrapped in teak and garden light — air-conditioned, quietly luxurious, and made for slow mornings. Two ways to stay, both moments from Canggu and Seminyak.</p>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ROOM 1 -->\n<section class=\"wrap split\" id=\"wooden-house\">\n  <div class=\"media\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/gallery-03.webp\" alt=\"Wooden House — private pool\"></div>\n  <div class=\"body reveal d1\">\n    <span class=\"label\">01 · Private Pool</span>\n    <h2>The Wooden House</h2>\n    <p>A freestanding teak house opening to the pool and garden. King bed, high wooden ceilings, and a bathtub set beneath open air — the coast is ten minutes away, but you won't want to leave.</p>\n    <ul class=\"amenities\">\n      <li>King bed</li><li>Private pool view</li><li>Open-air bathtub</li>\n      <li>Air conditioning</li><li>Garden terrace</li><li>Fast Wi-Fi</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"amt\">Rates on request</span><span class=\"per\">per night</span></div>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Check Availability</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ROOM 2 -->\n<section class=\"wrap split rev\" id=\"deluxe-studio\">\n  <div class=\"media\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/gallery-05.webp\" alt=\"Deluxe Studio\"></div>\n  <div class=\"body reveal d1\">\n    <span class=\"label\">02 · Garden View</span>\n    <h2>The Deluxe Studio</h2>\n    <p>A calm, light-filled studio framed by greenery. Soft linens, a rain shower, and morning sun through timber shutters — the quiet luxury of Bali, distilled into one restful room.</p>\n    <ul class=\"amenities\">\n      <li>Queen bed</li><li>Garden view</li><li>Rain shower</li>\n      <li>Air conditioning</li><li>Work nook</li><li>Fast Wi-Fi</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"amt\">Rates on request</span><span class=\"per\">per night</span></div>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Check Availability</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- BAND -->\n<section class=\"band\" style=\"background-image:url('/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/gallery-08.webp')\"></section>\n\n<!-- QUOTE -->\n<section class=\"quote\">\n  <div class=\"reveal\">\n    <span class=\"label\">Slow Living</span>\n    <p>Draw a bath beneath open air, float in the pool at first light, and let the garden do the rest.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- CTA OASIS -->\n<section class=\"oasis\" id=\"oasis\">\n  <div class=\"leaf\" style=\"background-image:url('/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/gallery-09.webp')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\"><h2>Reserve Your<br>Stay at Natajiwa</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"reveal d1\">\n      <p>Tell us your dates and we'll hold the room that fits your stay. Direct booking, warm welcome, and honest island rates.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn light\" href=\"/contact/\">Book Now</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->"
              }
